msgid ":q closes the window (:q! without asking about its tabs), :qa quits Beluga, :e or :cd PATH opens a folder, :tabnew [PATH], :tabclose, :tabonly, :sp or :vs [PATH] split the view, :only closes the other view, :mkdir NAME, :touch NAME, :set hidden / nohidden / hidden!, :set view=icons|compact|details|columns, :sort name|size|date|type, :pwd, :term, :du, :help, :!COMMAND runs a shell command in the folder."
msgstr ":q menutup jendela (:q! tanpa menanyakan tabnya), :qa keluar dari Beluga, :e atau :cd JALUR membuka folder, :tabnew [JALUR], :tabclose, :tabonly, :sp atau :vs [JALUR] membagi tampilan, :only menutup tampilan lain, :mkdir NAMA, :touch NAMA, :set hidden / nohidden / hidden!, :set view=icons|compact|details|columns, :sort name|size|date|type, :pwd, :term, :du, :help, :!PERINTAH menjalankan perintah shell di folder."

